 enjoy.\n\nPlayers can join lobbies, interact with others, and customize their look with different cosmetics while experiencing the playful chaos that makes movement-based games so entertaining.\n\nWhether you're exploring maps, messing around with friends, or just enjoying the vibe, project spec is all about community, creativity, and fun.", "short_description": "PROJECT FLICK is a fan-made game inspired by Gorilla Tag where players can run, climb, and explore seasonal maps with friends. Hang out in social lobbies, discover fun cosmetics, and enjoy fast-paced movement in a fresh seasonal world."}]}, "developer_name": "TFOE", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/projectflick/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TFOE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-flick/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26061261366907954"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1492797615676486_1258245768410092359_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gtGZNWaV3VcQ7kNvwFVvKvx&_nc_oc=Adp-D938H-Ak9ps-5zkURS7q-1wm1H_x_YFa4rmrdwXBNUfhe13dMZqvOo5BwQh8JnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&